WEBVTT

00:07:27.322 --> 00:07:31.524
Your throat protection
against irritation, against cough.]

00:07:31.548 --> 00:07:33.990
(Laughter)

00:07:34.014 --> 00:07:35.871
We laugh,

00:07:35.895 --> 00:07:37.641
but this was the kind of advertising

00:07:37.665 --> 00:07:40.656
that was there to send
a health message of reassurance.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:44.196
Fast-forward to 1950s, '60s and '70s.

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:47.172
And here, again,
in the absence of regulation,

00:07:47.196 --> 00:07:49.973
what we're going to see
is modifications to the product

00:07:49.997 --> 00:07:51.695
and product design

00:07:51.719 --> 00:07:54.404
to respond to the health
concerns of the day.

00:07:55.664 --> 00:07:59.093
This is the Kent Micronite filter.

00:07:59.117 --> 00:08:03.655
And here, the innovation, if you will,
was the filtered cigarette.